# Vibecoding OS — framework files to track
# NOTE: We intentionally DO track .claude/ files (hooks, skills, settings)
# because they're part of the project infrastructure.
# We do NOT track backups (they're ephemeral recovery files).
.claude/backups/*.md
!.claude/backups/.gitkeep
